goblin backpack~
a goblin backpack~
A strange backpack crafted from pine, and covered with tiny pouches.~
~
15 0 4097
75 0 0 0
10 50 0
E
goblin backpack~
Different from many other backpacks, this is more of a pine frame, with many
small pouches and bags nailed to the wood.  It is still quite useful for
storing many objects.
~
#10602
red silk ribbon~
a red silk ribbon~
A wren might of tried to use this ribbon to make a nest.~
~
8 0 3
0 0 0 0
1 25 0
E
red silk ribbon~
Perhaps stolen from a pretty dress, or the head of a little girl, this ribbon
has seen better days.  It appears to have been used to provide a bird with a
home at some point.
~
#10603
hunting spear~
a hunting spear~
A wicked spear with a sturdy crossbar to protect its wielder lies here.~
~
5 0 131073
12 4 3 24
1 0 0
E
hunting spear~
A solid crossbar near the head of this spear marks it as specially made for
hunting boar, or other large, vicious creatures.  The crossbar is supposed to
keep the creatures from impaling themselves far enough down the shaft that
they can attack the wielder.
~
